0,Languages of Mali - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Languages_of_Mali,"Mande, Senufo, and Dogon stand out among Niger–Congo because of their divergent SOV basic word order. The Gur languages are represented by Bomu on the Bani River of Mali and Burkina Faso. Fulfulde, spoken throughout West Africa, is a member of the Senegambian branch.","Dogon, Toro So",Niger-Congo
